  "sn46.99-110:0.3": "",
  "sn46.99-110:1.1": "seyyathāpi bhikkhave ye keci balakaraṇīyā kammantā kayirantīti vitthāretabbaṃ. ",
  "sn46.99-110:1.2": "",
  "sn46.99-110:2.0": "",
  "sn46.99-110:2.1": "balaṃ bījañca nāgo ca ",
  "sn46.99-110:2.2": "rukkhakumbhena sukiyā ",
  "sn46.99-110:2.3": "ākāsena ca dve meghā ",
  "sn46.99-110:2.4": "nāvā āgantukā nadī. ",
  "sn46.99-110:3.1": "(balakaraṇīyavaggo bojjhaṅgasaṃyuttassa bojjhaṅgavasena vitthāretabbo). balakaraṇīyavaggo ekādasamo. "
}
